Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:51:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add interleaved 8xH100 A/B timing harness and
 rule-2/rule-4 statistics

tools/speedrun_ab/ab_bench.py runs two checkouts in an ABBA leg order on one node (optionally
with cold compile caches per leg), keeps every leg in a ledger, and reports with ab_stats.py:
one-sided t-test of mean val loss vs 3.28 (rule 2), Welch's test and 95% CI on the wall-time
difference (rule 4), and a per-25-step-interval breakdown that localizes where time moved.
Dependency-free Student-t; reproduces ANVIL2's published baseline statistics.

